                                "sense_id": "caf95f43-efe5-377b-ae54-3d05ea15765e",
                                "text": "\"And it always seems to me,\" he went on ruminatingly, \"that, after all we are nothing better than interlopers on the earth, disfiguring and staining wherever we go. I know it's shocking blasphemy to say so, but then it's different here, you see. We are further away.\""
